<title>USA: Maxwell Shoe enters joint venture.</title>
<headline>Maxwell Shoe enters joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>HYDE PARK, Mass. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxwell Shoe Co Inc said Monday it had entered into a joint venture with a chain of women's shoe stores to operate more than 100 retail women's footwear stores in the United States.</p>
<p>Maxwell said it expected the effect of the venture on its earnings to be neutral during the 1997 fiscal year. It said it did not expect to recognize income or loss from its investment during that period.</p>
</text>
